# Run Time:

The reference decides what you can access, but the actual
object decides which overridden method runs


Imagin you are using a food delivery app

You click: PAY NOW

You don't care how payment happens

it could be:
UPI
Credit Card
Debit Card
Wallet

For app perspective, the operation is simply PAY

But each payment method performs the operation differently

               Payment
 UPI          CARD            Wallet
 pay()        pay()           pay()
 UPI          CARD            Wallet

 Is the action is different?
 No all the pay()

 Is the implementation different?
 Yes

 That the problem polymorphism help us to solve


 What is common between all these classes?
 pay()
